          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} — friendly wellness coaching focused on sustainable habits and clear outcomes.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f0f10;--card:#0f1720;--muted:#9aa3ad;--accent:#ffc857;--accent-2:#ff8a65;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--white: #f7f8fb;--radius:12px;font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071017 0%, #0b0f13 60%);color:var(--white);}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .brand .logo{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#102;box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(255,200,87,0.08)}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,200,87,0.12), rgba(255,138,101,0.06));color:var(--white)}\\n\\n    /* Hero gallery */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;margin-top:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:28px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .hero .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#102;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--white)}\\n\\n    /* Right column - contact card */\\n    .contact-card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .avatar{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3d6,#ffd2b2);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* Main form */\\n    form.field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:var(--glass);color:var(--white);outline:none}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .full{grid-column:1/-1}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n\\n    /* Ripples: small sections preview */\\n    .ripple-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:26px}\\n    .ripple{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:14px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .ripple h4{margin:4px 0 8px 0}\\n    .ripple p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* Testimonials preview */\\n    .test-preview{margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:10px;overflow:auto;padding-bottom:6px}\\n    .t{min-width:220px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:14px;border-radius:12px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n\\n    /* Responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:980px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .ripple-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\\n      form.field-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">WC</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <h2>Let’s design your next 90 days of health habits.</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Hi, I’m {{COACH_NAME}} ({{CREDENTIALS}}). I help busy people in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} build daily routines that stick—without overwhelm or fad diets. Start with a short consult and walk away with a clear first-week plan.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a consult</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"ripple-grid\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"ripple\\\" id=\\\"r-story\\\">\\n            <h4>Quick story</h4>\\n            <p>I scaled small daily wins into a new career and helped clients reduce anxiety around food and sleep by focusing on habits, not perfection.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ripple\\\" id=\\\"r-framework\\\">\\n            <h4>My framework</h4>\\n            <p>Clarify → Build → Anchor: clarity on motivation, micro-habit design, and integration into your week.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ripple\\\" id=\\\"r-programs\\\">\\n            <h4>Paths</h4>\\n            <p>Short: Momentum Starter. Mid: Habit Deepen. Long: Lifestyle Shift. Each has checkpoints and habit experiments.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"test-preview\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"t\\\"><strong>\\\"More energy in two weeks\\\"</strong><p class=\\\"note\\\">— Clara, 34</p></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"t\\\"><strong>\\\"Finally sustainable\\\"</strong><p class=\\\"note\\\">— Malik, 41</p></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"contact-card\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n            <!-- avatar svg reference -->\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"{{COACH_NAME}}\\\" width=\\\"56\\\" height=\\\"56\\\" style=\\\"display:block;border-radius:8px\\\">\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">{{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Reach out by phone or send a note — I reply within 48 hours.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Call</div>\\n            <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Email</div>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"field-grid\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"Optional\\\">\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"program\\\">Interested in</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"program\\\" name=\\\"program\\\">\\n                <option>Momentum Starter — 4 weeks</option>\\n                <option>Habit Deepen — 12 weeks</option>\\n                <option>Lifestyle Shift — 6 months</option>\\n                <option>Custom Package</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"full\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"message\\\">A short note — what are you hoping to change?</label>\\n              <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"I want more energy, clearer sleep, less stress...\\\" required></textarea>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"full\\\">\\n              <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"consent\\\"> I consent to receive a reply and occasional program updates.</label>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send message</button>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div id=\\\"formMsg\\\" class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;display:none\\\"></div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"pattern\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:12px\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px 0\\\">Free tool: The 7-Day Habit Sprint</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Grab a concise checklist + email guide that helps you test one habit for a week. Immediate, practical steps—no fluff.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Get the 7-Day Sprint</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Made for people who want real progress, weekly wins, and simpler routines.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // Minimal form handling — local-only demonstration\\n    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'there';\\n      var msg = document.getElementById('formMsg');\\n      msg.style.display = 'block';\\n      msg.style.color = 'var(--accent)';\\n      msg.textContent = 'Thanks ' + name + '! I received your note and will reply within 48 hours.';\\n      this.reset();\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Project: {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Wellness Coach Site\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page and a project README for a luxury gallery-style wellness coach website.\\n\\nFiles included in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — contact page designed for the lux_gallery layout. Includes:\\n  - Hero summary and ripple previews of story, framework, and programs.\\n  - Right-hand contact card with avatar (assets/img/avatar.svg) and contact form.\\n  - Form with basic client-side handling (no external services).\\n  - Lead magnet promotion and testimonial snippets.\\n  - Uses placeholders throughout; update with your real values.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace or use with a templating engine:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: lux_gallery — large image/graphic references and restrained motion.\\n- No external fonts, CDNs, or analytics are included.\\n- Assets referenced (add to project):\\n  - assets/img/hero.svg\\n  - assets/img/avatar.svg\\n  - assets/img/pattern.svg\\n\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\n- Simple form behavior is implemented inline — adapt to your serverless form handler or backend.\\n- All links point to the local pages in this project: index.html, about.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html, contact.html\\n\\nCustomization checklist:\\n- Replace placeholders with real content or integrate with your templating system.\\n- Provide the required SVGs in the assets/img directory.\\n- Hook the contact form to your email/CRM endpoint or a service like Formspree if needed.\\n- Review copy to align with brand voice and compliance (no clinical claims).\\n\\nNotes on site structure:\\n- This chunk only contains contact.html and README.md. Other pages (index, about, programs, pricing, testimonials, book) are in other chunks.\\n- Ensure nav labels remain consistent across pages; slight variations were intentionally used (e.g., \\\"Paths\\\", \\\"Invest\\\", \\\"Stories\\\").\\n\\nIf you need alternate contact form behaviors (file upload, calendar integration, conditional questions), tell me which provider you want and I will add a tailored implementation.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
